{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act50side_level_act50side_08_beg","storyGroup":"act50side","storySort":16,"storyDependence":"act50side_level_act50side_07_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TD-8","storyName":"宿命流转，苍霆激荡","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"“雷之主”或许不是罪魁祸首，一行人决定借助它的力量。但是，孤高的王者并不会轻易地对他们伸出援手，大战在所难免——","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act50side/level_act50side_08_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act50side_08","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":14,"next":16,"characters":["月见夜","斑弥罗","随从武士","宝巫迦","随从武士们","梓兰","空爆","受伤的武士","泡影国百姓","政宗","“雷之主”"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_bg_71_g10_bottomruins.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tense_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_tense_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing6","volume":"1","id":9},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":11},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":12},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing4","volume":"1","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":15},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"所有人听着！","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我犯了一个巨大的错误。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我将国家存亡，“试炼”的意义，“雷之主”的强大这些东西挂在嘴边，但归根结底，我想，我在恐惧面对它。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"一旦对某件事产生了恐惧，人就会退缩，就会为自己找各种各样的借口进行逃避。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"建立狩猎团，将你们按照士兵的方式进行训练，阻止陛下前往挑战“雷之主”，并不是因为我有多么深谋远虑，而仅仅是因为——","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我不够强大。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我甚至将这种恐惧传递给了你们。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我要求你们审慎，要求你们学会见机行事，要求你们不要为了狩猎拼上性命......","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"但是，我却没有把最重要的东西传达给你们。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"唉，我说你啊，总是这么悲观又自大。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"泡影国就算真的毁灭了，也不是你一个人的责任。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"随从武士","text":"没错，将军，正如您平时告诫我们的那样，我们并非只是盲从您的命令而选择了保守。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"随从武士","text":"我们选择成为狩猎团的一员，我们选择以成为武士的方式守卫我们的家园，是因为我们也认为，这样是正确的！","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"随从武士","text":"您从来没有做错过什么，如果我们真的失败了，那也只是我们做得不够好，仅此而已。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"......","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"说的也是，或许比起后悔，我更应该庆幸。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"庆幸我最终得知了真相，庆幸我并没有成为想象中那个绝情的人。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"庆幸我此时此刻，至少还有能为陛下做到的事情。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"陛下。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我不断说服自己没有错，我不断告诉自己，我已经在诸多不好的选择中选择了相对正确的那一个。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"久而久之，它竟然似乎变成了唯一的答案......","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我早该多和您聊一聊，我早该和您齐心协力。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这一点，或许吾也是一样的。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"回去之后，吾会和你开诚布公地聊一聊。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":52},{"type":"multiline","name":"月见夜","text":"我期待着那天的到来。","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":54},{"type":"multiline","name":"月见夜","text":"狩猎团听令！","id":55},{"type":"charslot","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"随从武士们","text":"在！","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"以方阵为单位行动，向前推进，为宝巫迦陛下和“异兽猎人”开辟道路！","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"为了我们的未来！","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"随从武士们","text":"是！","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":69},{"type":"charslot","id":70},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"70","randomness":"95","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":71},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sldrchrg","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":72},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"2","id":73},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"随从武士们","text":"冲啊！为了泡影国，为了宝巫迦陛下！","id":75},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"charslot","id":77},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"70","randomness":"95","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":78},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_battlepresent","volume":"1","id":79},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":80},{"type":"charslot","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"哈哈，我也来助你们一臂之力！","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":84},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shipcannon","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":86},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shipcannon","id":87},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":88},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"60","ystrength":"60","vibrato":"70","randomness":"80","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":89},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_explosion","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":91},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"60","ystrength":"60","vibrato":"70","randomness":"80","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":92},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_explosion","id":93},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":94},{"type":"charslot","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"说真的，老朋友。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"世事当真是难以预料。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"想要做的事情总是一件也没有做好，结果，在以为自己即将失败的时候，却突然又发现，自己好像也没有那么失败。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"这你就不懂了，在我们发明界，这样的事情，几乎每天都要发生一次！","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"成功总是偶然的！但是，只要结果够好，不就可以了吗？","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"哈，说的也是！","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"陛下，去吧！","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"陛下，要是需要火力支援就喊我，正好让我测试一下射程！","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"嗯！","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":112},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":114},{"type":"charslot","id":115},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"dialog","id":118},{"type":"charslot","id":119},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0C/Avg_bg_71_g11_invertedaltar_closed.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":124},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这里......这座祭坛......过去的泡影国的人们就是在这里......","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"越是靠近这里，吾越是能清晰地感觉到“诅咒”的气息。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾终于明白，在雪山时，那股牵引吾的力量究竟是什么了......","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾曾以为是“雷之主”，其实应该是“御轮”，一直以来，都是“御轮”在牵制吾......","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"母亲，一切的元凶，“试炼”的真相，是“御轮”，对吗？","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾来了，“雷之主”。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":136},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":137},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":138},{"type":"dialog","id":139},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0C/Avg_bg_71_g11_invertedaltar_closed.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":144},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smock","layer":"1","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2102_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":146},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"70","randomness":"95","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":147},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_burst","volume":"1","channel":"burst1","id":148},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_lighting","layer":"1","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":150},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"70","randomness":"95","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":151},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_burst","volume":"1","channel":"burst2","id":152},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":153},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"70","randomness":"95","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":154},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_burst","volume":"1","channel":"burst3","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":156},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_chainsaw_finish","volume":"1","channel":"finish","id":157},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":158},{"type":"charslot","id":159},{"type":"bgeffect","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"宝巫迦，趁现在！","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"嗯！","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":165},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_purifymagic","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":166},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_light","x":"-9","y":"-67","layer":"1","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"求你了，“雷之主”，吾等只希望你能把力量借给吾等！","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"0.5","id":170},{"type":"dialog","id":171},{"type":"charslot","id":172},{"type":"bgeffect","id":173},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"70","randomness":"95","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":174},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smock","layer":"1","id":175},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_skillroar_normal","volume":"2","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2102_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":178},{"type":"charslot","id":179},{"type":"bgeffect","id":180},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"唔——","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"怎么办，梓兰姐？好像不起效啊！","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"啧，真是个顽强的家伙。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7E/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"明明我们已经对它造成了那么多的伤害，它居然毫无怯意，不仅如此，它还愈战愈勇。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7E/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"是“诅咒”剥夺了它的意志吗？","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"还是说，是它——","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，不对，“雷之主”的样子——","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":194},{"type":"text","text":"异变陡生。","id":195},{"type":"text","text":"在挣脱了宝巫迦的力量之后，这一次，“雷之主”并没有立刻袭来，而是开始了痛苦的嘶吼。","id":196},{"type":"text","text":"“雷之主”的身体在不断地挣扎，黑气在它身上如同蒸汽一般冒出，令人毛骨悚然。","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#15$2","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，它的样子，它看起来要被“诅咒”彻底吞噬了！难道我们只能杀死它了吗？","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......空爆，不能留手了。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"如果“雷之主”真的被“诅咒”吞噬，一定会酿成大祸。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#15$2","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"......我知道了。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"宝巫迦，明白了吗？","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"不必考虑任何事，我们已经尽了我们最大的努力，无论得到什么样的结果，我们也只能坦然接受。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......嗯。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":211},{"type":"multiline","name":"梓兰","text":"趁现在，它还在挣扎，把它——","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":213},{"type":"multiline","name":"梓兰","text":"咦？","id":214},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_hyper","layer":"1","id":217},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"雷光虫？","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"什么时候......","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"是从竹林那边飞过来的！","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":225},{"type":"text","text":"灰暗的地下遗迹之中，不知何时，架起了一道青色的“桥”。","id":226},{"type":"text","text":"而组成这道“桥”的，正是从地下竹林的方向飞来的雷光虫们。","id":227},{"type":"text","text":"它们越来越多地开始在“雷之主”身边环绕，仿佛正在酝酿着什么。","id":228},{"type":"text","text":"随着雷光虫的增多，“雷之主”身上的黑气也变得更加旺盛。","id":229},{"type":"text","text":"但是，在那些青色萤火的照耀下，“雷之主”竟也显得少了几分污浊，多了一丝危险的美丽。","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"它们难道是受到了“雷之主”的召唤？但是......为什么？","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"“雷之主”，难道你——","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，我有一种直觉。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"它没有被“诅咒”完全侵染......它一直都在和“诅咒”对抗，并且，现在，它快要赢了？","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":237},{"type":"text","text":"在所有人迟疑之际，“雷之主”的痛苦似乎减弱了几分，它敏捷地跳上了高处。","id":238},{"type":"text","text":"它站在那里，高昂地抬起了它的头颅，发出一声悠长的吼声。","id":239},{"type":"text","text":"然后——地裂山崩。","id":240},{"type":"dialog","id":241},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":242},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":243},{"type":"dialog","id":244},{"type":"bgeffect","id":245},{"type":"charslot","id":246},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_bg_71_g2_impermanence_room.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的武士","text":"唔——我还能战斗！","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓","text":"别逞强。你的位置有其他武士顶上，现在先好好休息吧！","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_2108_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的武士","text":"我，我杀了好几只野兽！我没有给将军丢人！","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓","text":"放心吧，所有人都是好样的。现在，好好休息吧。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_2108_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓","text":"（低声）陛下，斑弥罗大人，还有各位，我们会把我们的国家保卫好，请你们一定要平安无事啊......","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_2108_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的武士","text":"咦......","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2108_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"泡影国百姓","text":"嗯？","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_2108_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的武士","text":"我是不是眼花了？我怎么看到“御轮”那里，聚集起了乌云？","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":266},{"type":"text","text":"泡影城中，人们共同抬起了头，看向了“御轮”——","id":267},{"type":"dialog","id":268},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":269},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":270},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":271},{"type":"dialog","id":272},{"type":"charslot","id":273},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":274},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":275},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"1","channel":"2","id":276},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":278},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":279},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":280},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_darkcloud_thunder","layer":"1","x":"0","xto":"0","yto":"-140","y":"140","movetime":"25","id":281},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":282},{"type":"text","text":"一道粗壮的天雷突破夜晚的乌云，砸在了“御轮”方向的雪山之中。","id":283},{"type":"text","text":"若是有人离得近一些，他会发现，天雷居然生生地在地上砸出一个大洞，而大洞通往的地方，深不见底。","id":284},{"type":"text","text":"但他一定听得到，那一声从地底传来的震天怒吼——","id":285},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"2","fadetime":"2","id":286},{"type":"dialog","id":287},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":288},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":289},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"charslot","id":291},{"type":"bgeffect","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":293},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":295},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_hyper_insect","channel":"3","volume":"1","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":297},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_071cg_hyper","id":298},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_hyper_roar","channel":"4","volume":"1","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":300},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_hyper_roar2","channel":"5","volume":"1","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":302},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_skillroar_hyper","channel":"6","volume":"1","id":303},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_71_i09.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":304},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":305},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"70","randomness":"95","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":306},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$MHR_bat_monsterhunter2boss_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act50side/m_bat_monsterhunter2boss_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":307,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":308},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_hyper","layer":"1","id":309},{"type":"text","text":"那是饱含野性的怒吼。","id":310},{"type":"text","text":"伴随着怒吼，粗壮的天雷击穿了或许本就没有那么牢固的岩盘，砸在了“雷之主”的身上。","id":311},{"type":"text","text":"虽然只是刹那间的电光，却让原本灰暗的地下空间都仿佛为之一震。","id":312},{"type":"text","text":"沐浴在雷光之下的“雷之主”，仿佛完成了最后一点蜕变，它再次发出一声怒吼。","id":313},{"type":"text","text":"这一次，青色的闪电缠满了它的周身。","id":314},{"type":"text","text":"竖立的鬃毛像纯白的浪涛被骤然定格，每一缕都裹着闪电，电弧在毛尖炸裂，洒下碎星。","id":315},{"type":"text","text":"鳞甲犹如碧玉，其间流淌着金白光河。尾巴甩动，电火花在空中拉出一条条琥珀色的光鞭，将黑暗划开一道道裂痕。","id":316},{"type":"text","text":"天雷砸开的洞中，洒下一缕月光。","id":317},{"type":"text","text":"在月光照耀之下，它恍若世间最尊贵的王者。","id":318},{"type":"text","text":"所有的野兽都在这一刻停下了它们的行动。","id":319},{"type":"dialog","id":320},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"charslot","id":324},{"type":"image","id":325},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_bg_71_g12_invertedaltar_dawn.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":327},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":328},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"它......难道依靠雷电自己清除了诅咒？","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"不，梓兰姐，你仔细看。","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"它的身上依然散发着“诅咒”的黑气......但是它的行动，看起来和之前很不一样......","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"它不是清除了“诅咒”，而是克服了“诅咒”，完全把“诅咒”变成了自己力量的一部分！","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，看来好像是我们多此一举了。","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......是啊，这片大地上的事情真是永远不能一概而论。","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我们自以为从前代陛下那里得到了关键的情报，以为我们要做的事情是拯救“雷之主”。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我们心心念念地想要拯救“雷之主”，想要将它从“诅咒”的深渊中解放出来......","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"结果，它看来并不怎么需要我们的拯救。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2E/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"也不一定啦。","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C7/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"野兽总是在战斗中磨练自己，如果没有和我们的战斗，它恐怕也没有办法克服“诅咒”。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"从这个角度来说，我们也算是“拯救”了它，不是吗？","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AB/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......也许吧。","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":353},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice1","volume":"1","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"陛下，趁现在，对它使用御龙术喵！","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"让它的力量为你所用喵！","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾试一试——","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":359},{"type":"charslot","id":360},{"type":"text","text":"一道雷光劈下，直接将宝巫迦手中的翔虫打落，“雷之主”不屑地喷了喷气，似乎并不满意宝巫迦的行为。","id":361},{"type":"text","text":"但它没有进行下一步行动，只是静静地看着宝巫迦。","id":362},{"type":"text","text":"像是在等待着什么。","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"看来，不彻底战胜它，它是不愿意让你对它使用御龙术的。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E0/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......是啊。","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":368},{"type":"bgeffect","id":369},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"dialog","id":372},{"type":"charslot","id":373},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":374},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":375},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_71_i10.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":376},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_hyper","x":"300","layer":"1","id":377},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":378},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"在得知真相后，吾是对你心存愧疚的，“雷之主”。","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"毕竟，你只是“诅咒”的受害者，况且，如果不是你凭借本能捕食被“诅咒”的野兽，或许“诅咒”的蔓延会更加迅猛。","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"但是，将你招至泡影国的并非吾等，这些年吾的国家和国民也一直生活在你的阴影之下。","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"况且，无论如何，吾最敬爱的母亲还是死在你的手上......","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾也不能就这样轻易放下心中的怨怼。","id":384},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_normalroar3","volume":"1","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“雷之主”","text":"（低吼）","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"它听不懂你说的这些的，宝巫迦。","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"它只是野兽，它既不会因为被“御轮”传送到一个奇特的国度就对自己的境遇产生迷茫，也不会因为被“诅咒”侵扰而痛恨自己的命运。","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"它只是凭借着自己的本性去扛起了这一切。","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"来到了新的天地，那就在新的天地活下去。","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"被“诅咒”侵扰，那就克服“诅咒”。","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"咒鬼要杀它，它就杀死咒鬼。","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"除此之外，它不关心你是否恨它，也不关心你是否爱它，这对它来说，并不重要......","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"生命的本能，就只是活下去。","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"没错，即使还有“御轮”这个威胁当前，它还是不愿意和我们联手。","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"毕竟，我们要做的事情，可是在挑战它作为王者的威严。","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"说到底，最后还是要交给手中的武器嘛。","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......说得也是。","id":398},{"type":"text","text":"旭日东升，今天是个狩猎的好日子。","id":399},{"type":"dialog","id":400},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":401},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":402},{"type":"bgeffect","id":403},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":404},{"type":"image","id":405},{"type":"charslot","id":406}],"characters":["月见夜","斑弥罗","随从武士","宝巫迦","随从武士们","梓兰","空爆","受伤的武士","泡影国百姓","政宗","“雷之主”"]}